{"title":"Let's start a conversation.","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"","pagetitle":"Contact | Justin Mai","description":"Contact Justin Mai about statistics, data science, visualization, and project opportunities.","page-layout":"full"},"headingText":"Let's start a conversation.","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n:::: {.contact-hero .section-shell}\n\n::: {.contact-intro .reveal}\n<span class=\"eyebrow\"><i class=\"bi bi-chat-dots\"></i> Get in touch</span>\n\n\nHave a question, an opportunity, or an interesting dataset? Send me a message. I'm always glad to connect and hear what you're working on.\n\n<div class=\"contact-actions\">\n  <a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"mailto:justinmai042@gmail.com\">Email me <i class=\"bi bi-send\"></i></a>\n  <a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"Justin-Mai-Resume-2026.pdf\">Download résumé <i class=\"bi bi-download\"></i></a>\n</div>\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-orbit .reveal .delay-1 aria-hidden=\"true\"}\n<div class=\"orbit-ring ring-one\"></div>\n<div class=\"orbit-ring ring-two\"></div>\n<div class=\"orbit-center\"><span>JM</span></div>\n<i class=\"orbit-dot dot-one\"></i><i class=\"orbit-dot dot-two\"></i><i class=\"orbit-dot dot-three\"></i>\n:::\n\n::::\n\n:::: {.contact-grid .section-shell}\n\n::: {.contact-card .interactive-card .reveal}\n<span class=\"card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-envelope\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"contact-label\">Email</span>\n\n### Say hello directly\n\n<a class=\"contact-value\" href=\"mailto:justinmai042@gmail.com\">justinmai042@gmail.com</a>\n\n<button class=\"copy-button\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"justinmai042@gmail.com\"><i class=\"bi bi-copy\"></i> Copy address</button>\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-card .interactive-card .reveal .delay-1}\n<span class=\"card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-telephone\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"contact-label\">Phone</span>\n\n### Prefer a quick call?\n\n<a class=\"contact-value\" href=\"tel:+16262717071\">+1 (626) 271-7071</a>\n\n<span class=\"contact-caption\">Tap the number to call</span>\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-card .interactive-card .reveal .delay-2}\n<span class=\"card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-github\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"contact-label\">GitHub</span>\n\n### See what I'm building\n\n<a class=\"contact-value\" href=\"https://github.com/JustinMai042\">@JustinMai042</a>\n\n<span class=\"contact-caption\">Projects, experiments, and code</span>\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-card .interactive-card .reveal .delay-3}\n<span class=\"card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"contact-label\">LinkedIn</span>\n\n### Connect professionally\n\n<a class=\"contact-value\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/justin-mai-1b1ba8255/\">Justin Mai</a>\n\n<span class=\"contact-caption\">Let's grow our networks</span>\n:::\n\n::::\n\n::: {.availability-note .section-shell .reveal}\n<span class=\"availability-dot\"></span>\n<div>\n<strong>Thanks for stopping by.</strong>\n<span>I read every message and will get back to you as soon as I can.</span>\n</div>\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n:::: {.contact-hero .section-shell}\n\n::: {.contact-intro .reveal}\n<span class=\"eyebrow\"><i class=\"bi bi-chat-dots\"></i> Get in touch</span>\n\n# Let's start a conversation.\n\nHave a question, an opportunity, or an interesting dataset? Send me a message. I'm always glad to connect and hear what you're working on.\n\n<div class=\"contact-actions\">\n  <a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"mailto:justinmai042@gmail.com\">Email me <i class=\"bi bi-send\"></i></a>\n  <a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"Justin-Mai-Resume-2026.pdf\">Download résumé <i class=\"bi bi-download\"></i></a>\n</div>\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-orbit .reveal .delay-1 aria-hidden=\"true\"}\n<div class=\"orbit-ring ring-one\"></div>\n<div class=\"orbit-ring ring-two\"></div>\n<div class=\"orbit-center\"><span>JM</span></div>\n<i class=\"orbit-dot dot-one\"></i><i class=\"orbit-dot dot-two\"></i><i class=\"orbit-dot dot-three\"></i>\n:::\n\n::::\n\n:::: {.contact-grid .section-shell}\n\n::: {.contact-card .interactive-card .reveal}\n<span class=\"card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-envelope\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"contact-label\">Email</span>\n\n### Say hello directly\n\n<a class=\"contact-value\" href=\"mailto:justinmai042@gmail.com\">justinmai042@gmail.com</a>\n\n<button class=\"copy-button\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"justinmai042@gmail.com\"><i class=\"bi bi-copy\"></i> Copy address</button>\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-card .interactive-card .reveal .delay-1}\n<span class=\"card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-telephone\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"contact-label\">Phone</span>\n\n### Prefer a quick call?\n\n<a class=\"contact-value\" href=\"tel:+16262717071\">+1 (626) 271-7071</a>\n\n<span class=\"contact-caption\">Tap the number to call</span>\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-card .interactive-card .reveal .delay-2}\n<span class=\"card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-github\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"contact-label\">GitHub</span>\n\n### See what I'm building\n\n<a class=\"contact-value\" href=\"https://github.com/JustinMai042\">@JustinMai042</a>\n\n<span class=\"contact-caption\">Projects, experiments, and code</span>\n:::\n\n::: {.contact-card .interactive-card .reveal .delay-3}\n<span class=\"card-icon\"><i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i></span>\n<span class=\"contact-label\">LinkedIn</span>\n\n### Connect professionally\n\n<a class=\"contact-value\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/justin-mai-1b1ba8255/\">Justin Mai</a>\n\n<span class=\"contact-caption\">Let's grow our networks</span>\n:::\n\n::::\n\n::: {.availability-note .section-shell .reveal}\n<span class=\"availability-dot\"></span>\n<div>\n<strong>Thanks for stopping by.</strong>\n<span>I read every message and will get back to you as soon as I can.</span>\n</div>\n:::\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":tru